<title>UK: KEPCO sets 150 million stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>KEPCO sets 150 million stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA ELECTRIC POWER CO (KEPCO)</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    27.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   S28.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+78 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED. S-SHORT FIRST COUPONU</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/KR/HK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.50 PCT DEC 2006 GILT -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
